---
description: Security and privacy rules
globs:
  - "server/**"
  - "android/**"
  - "infrastructure/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Enforce user ownership on every learner-specific resource.
- Do not trust userId supplied in request bodies when identity is available from authentication.
- Validate audio type, duration and size before processing.
- Secrets come from environment or secret managers only.
- Redact authorization headers, API keys and sensitive text from logs.
- Respect privacy settings for raw text and audio persistence.
- Data deletion must be auditable, idempotent and include object storage cleanup.
- Generated content must be treated as untrusted input before rendering.
